The '''Pnakotic Coast'''<ref name="Solo TOG" /> was an area of coastline on the [[planet]] [[Savareen]].<ref name="Solo" /> Both the [[Bis Refinery]] and the [[Pnakotic Coast village]] were located on the Pnakotic Coast.<ref name="Solo TOG" />

{{Loc-stub}}

==Behind the scenes==
The Pnakotic Coast first appeared in the [[2018]] [[Star Wars Anthology Series|Anthology]] movie ''[[Solo: A Star Wars Story]]'',<ref name="Solo" /> and was first identified in ''[[Solo: A Star Wars Story The Official Guide]]''.<ref name="Solo TOG" /> In the script for ''Solo'', the area was named the Pnakotic Dunes as a nod to [[Wikipedia:H. P. Lovecraft|H. P. Lovecraft]].<ref name="Jon's Twitter">{{Twitter|JonKasdan|status/1040529511513616385|[[Jon Kasdan]]|quote=continued|archivedate=20181002054217}}</ref>

